{"id":"reprise","lemma":"reprise","pos":"noun","rank":4191,"glosses":["time, instance","start after a pause, e.g. a second-half kick-off","a round"],"ipa":"/ʁə.pʁiz/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bd/Fr-reprise.ogg/Fr-reprise.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"reprises"},"formAudio":{"reprises":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-reprises.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous l'avons fait à plusieurs reprises.","en":"We've done that several times.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"several, many, a lot"},null]},{"text":"Cela s'est produit à plusieurs reprises.","en":"That happened on several occasions.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"product"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"several, many, a lot"},null]},{"text":"Tu m'as menti à plusieurs reprises.","en":"You've lied to me repeatedly.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to lie","l":"mentir"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"several, many, a lot"},null]},{"text":"Il relut la lettre à plusieurs reprises.","en":"He read the letter over and over.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"letter"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"several, many, a lot"},null]},{"text":"Je l'ai vu à maintes reprises.","en":"I have seen him many times.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"to / at"},null,null]}]}